        "details": {
            "description": "<p>A magical cooking device overloads, conjuring vegetal manifestations from the ethereal plane that rampage throughout the large kitchen.</p>",
            "disable": "<p>@Check[arcana|dc:16], @Check[nature|dc:16], @Check[occultism|dc:16] or @Check[religion|dc:16] to close the planar incursion, or @Check[crafting|dc:17] (trained) or @Check[thievery|dc:17] (trained) to deactivate the machine, or @Check[Cooking Lore|dc:13] (trained) to reduce the manifestations to dust; three total successes are required to disable the trap</p>",
            "isComplex": true,
            "level": {
                "value": 1
            },
            "publication": {
                "license": "ORC",
                "remaster": false,
                "title": "Starfinder Society Adventures : 2-03 Bittersweet"
            },
            "reset": "",
            "routine": "<p>(2 action) A swarm of nightmare vegetables gang up to attack one creature in area <strong>C</strong>, dealing @Damage[(1d6+3)[bludgeoning]] damage (@Check[reflex|dc:17|basic] save). The magical device then releases a burst of energy, dealing @Damage[2d6[spirit]] damage to all creatures within 15 feet of the device (@Check[fortitude|dc:17|basic] save).</p>"
